  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:21:04+05:30\">January 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:21 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://scholarship.up.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Social Welfare Department of Uttar Pradesh</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>notification</strong> for the <strong>UP Scholarship 2025-26</strong> for students of <strong>Class 9–10 (Pre-Matric)</strong>, <strong>Class 11–12 (Post-Matric)</strong>, and <strong>Post-Matric Other Than Intermediate.</strong> The online application process will be open from <strong>02 July 2025 to 30 October 2025</strong> for Pre-<strong>Matric and Post-Matric</strong>, and from <strong>10 July 2025 to 20 December 2025</strong> for <strong>Post-Matric Other Than Intermediate.</strong> Interested candidates must check the <strong>eligibility criteria, age limit</strong>, and read the <strong>full notification</strong> before applying. <strong>Eligible students</strong> can submit their applications online within the given dates.<br>\n</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Scheme 2025-26 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-scholarship-online-form-2025-26/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><strong>09-10th Pre Matric&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Start Date :<strong>&nbsp;02 July 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Last Date : <strong>30 October 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Form Complete :&nbsp;<strong>31 October 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College :&nbsp;<strong>04 November 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>31 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li><strong>11th-12th Post Matric&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Start Date :<strong>&nbsp;02 July 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Last Date : <strong>30 October 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Form Complete :&nbsp;<strong>31 October 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College :&nbsp;<strong>04 November 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>31 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Post Matric Other than Intermediate&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Start Date :<strong> 10 July 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Online Apply Last Date : <strong>20 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Form Complete :&nbsp;<strong>20 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date For Submission of Hard Copy To College :&nbsp;<strong>24 December 2025</strong></li>\n<li>Send Scholarship in Bank Account Date :&nbsp;<strong>24 January 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">No Application Fee For Any Candidates</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26 : Age Limits As On Official Website Rules.</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Not Specified Check Official Website.</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">N/A</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26 : Examination Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 68.5861%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26 : Document Required&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 68.5861%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Candidates have to attach the following documents along with the Hard copy of the Online Application Form:</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Qualifying Exam Mark Sheet</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Income Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bank Passbook</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fee Receipt Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Annual Non Refundable Amount</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enrollment Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aadhar Card Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Latest Passport Size Scan Photo</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For Renewal Candidates –</strong>&nbsp;Kindly Use Last Year Registration Number to Login to Renewal Section and Enter the Fresh Details</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Scholarship Name</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For Class</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pre Matric</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Class 09th &amp; Class 10th</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Post Matric</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Class 11th &amp; Class 12th</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Dashmottar</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UG / PG / Diploma &amp; Certificate Courses</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Criteria</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Domicile</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates hailing from Uttar Pradesh and having Domicile of Uttar Pradesh can only avail this Scholarship facility.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pre Matric</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Class 09th candidates they should clear their class 8th level of examination and enrolled with Class 09th &amp; For Class 10th candidates they should clear their class 09th level of examination and enrolled with Class 10th can fill this Scholarship Form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Post Matric</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Class 11th candidates they should clear their class 10th level of examination and enrolled with Class 11h &amp; For Class 12th candidates they should clear their class 11th level of examination and enrolled with Class 12th can fill this Scholarship Form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Dashmottar</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must be enrolled in any UG / PG / Diploma / Certificate Examination can fill up this scholarship form.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-cgl-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SSC CGL Online Form 2025</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Fill UP Scholarship Online Form 2025-26&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates who wish to apply for the <strong>UP Scholarship</strong>&nbsp;post can submit their application online before <strong>20</strong> <strong>December 2025.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Use the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Alternatively, visit the&nbsp;<strong>official website of UP Scholarship</strong>&nbsp;to complete the application process online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Make sure to complete the application before the deadline &nbsp;<a href=\"https://scholarship.up.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>20 December 2025.</strong></span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Scholarship Form For Offline Submission 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After filling the Online Scholarship Form candidates need to take the print put of complete form and after that they have to attach relevant documents (specified above) &amp; are required to send it to the respective College / School / Institution before due Date.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VavXmlBEAKWFRHeXwL28\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our Telegram Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresultoficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>One Time Registration (OTR)</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"w